# The commitment is the number this whole stage was aimed at: 9.1 minutes at
# BLOCKS = 1024, inside 8.4 GiB, where the frozen baseline is 9.95 s per block
# (39.8 s at four blocks) = 2.8 HOURS, and could not run at all for want of
